    "synopsis": {
        "native": "F\u00e9licie est une jeune orpheline bretonne qui n\u2019a qu\u2019une passion : la danse. Avec son meilleur ami Victor qui aimerait devenir un grand inventeur, ils mettent au point un plan rocambolesque pour s\u2019\u00e9chapper de l\u2019Orphelinat, direction Paris, ville lumi\u00e8re et sa Tour Eiffel en construction ! F\u00e9licie devra se battre comme jamais, se d\u00e9passer et apprendre de ses erreurs pour r\u00e9aliser son r\u00eave le plus fou : devenir danseuse \u00e9toile \u00e0 l\u2019Op\u00e9ra de Paris\u2026",
        "english": "F\u00e9licie is a young Breton orphan with only one passion: dance. With her best friend Victor, who would like to become a great inventor, she puts together a nutty plan in order to escape from the orphanage and to head for Paris, the City of Lights with its Eiffel Tower now under construction. F\u00e9licie must fight like she's never fought before to overcome and to learn from her mistakes in order to fulfill her most crazy dream: to become the prima ballerina at the Paris Opera..."
